al phenomenon: OPE10: Failure of material, due to fatigue, corrosion, shredding, etc. The company STS S.A. sends the following background (probatory) to accredit the physical phenomenon declared: \u2022 Report of maintenances. \u2022 Technical report explaining the possible causes that facilitate the failure of material. \u2022 Photographic record with date, time and coordinates UTM of the fault point. d.3 Confirmation: Repetition Phenomenon Physical in the affected installation: There have been no failures in the same installation due to the same physical phenomenon, during the last 24 mobi","es":"Estudio para an\u00e1lisis de falla EAF 276/2024\n\u201cFalla en la l\u00ednea 66 kV Valdivia - Picarte\u201d\nFecha de Emisi\u00f3n: 10-07-2024\n1. Descripci\u00f3n general de la interrupci\u00f3n\na. Fecha y Hora de la falla\nFecha 18/06/2024\nHora 12:13\nConsumos desconectados (MW) 49.45\nDemanda previa del sistema (MW) 11572.80\nPorcentaje de desconexi\u00f3n 0.400%\nCalificaci\u00f3n Apag\u00f3n No aplica (porcentaje de desconexi\u00f3n < 10%)\nb. Identificaci\u00f3n instalaci\u00f3n afectada\nNombre de la instalaci\u00f3n L\u00ednea 66 kV Valdivia - Picarte / LT014CI1TR03T003ST02T003\nTipo de instalaci\u00f3n L\u00ednea\nTensi\u00f3n nominal 66 kV\nSegmento Transmisi\u00f3n zonal\nPropietario instalaci\u00f3n afectada Sistema de Transmisi\u00f3n del Sur S.A.\nRUT 77.312.201-6\nRepresentante Legal Francisco Alliende\nDirecci\u00f3n Manuel Bulnes 441, Osorno.\nc. Identificaci\u00f3n del elemento fallado\nNombre del elemento fallado L\u00ednea 66 kV Valdivia - Picarte / LT014CI1TR03T003ST02T003\nPropietario elemento fallado Sistema de Transmisi\u00f3n del Sur S.A.\nRUT 77.312.201-6\nRepresentante Legal Francisco Alliende\nDirecci\u00f3n Manuel Bulnes 441, Osorno.\nd.1 Origen y causa de la falla\nSe produjo la apertura autom\u00e1tica del interruptor 52BT4 de S/E Valdivia, correspondiente a la l\u00ednea 66\nkV Valdivia - Picarte, por medio de la operaci\u00f3n de su protecci\u00f3n de distancia de fases en segunda\nzona.\nLa empresa STS S.A. declara que la falla fue debido a corte de conductor en la estructura N\u00b0AT17995\nde la l\u00ednea 66 kV Valdivia - Picarte, a causa de fatiga de material, probablemente a consecuencia del\nmovimiento pendular del conductor producto de los vientos en la zona.\nd.2 Fen\u00f3meno F\u00edsico:\nOPE10: Falla de material, por fatiga, corrosi\u00f3n, trizadura, etc.\nLa empresa STS S.A. remite los siguientes antecedentes (probatorios) para acreditar el fen\u00f3meno f\u00edsico\ndeclarado:\n\u2022 Reporte de mantenimientos.\n\u2022 Informe t\u00e9cnico que explica","shown_language":"en","word_scores":[{"w":"study","s":0.06},{"w":"failure","s":0.16},{"w":"eaf","s":0.01},{"w":"2024","s":-0.11},{"w":"fault","s":0.26},{"w":"line","s":1.0},{"w":"66","s":-0.47},{"w":"kv","s":-0.08},{"w":"date","s":-0.04},{"w":"description","s":0.01},{"w":"date","s":-0.04},{"w":"time","s":-0.1},{"w":"failure","s":0.16},{"w":"date","s":-0.04},{"w":"18","s":-0.34},{"w":"06","s":0.43},{"w":"2024","s":-0.11},{"w":"time","s":-0.1},{"w":"12","s":0.04},{"w":"13","s":-0.16},{"w":"consumptions","s":-0.18},{"w":"mw","s":0.05},{"w":"prior","s":0.08},{"w":"mw","s":0.05},{"w":"percentage","s":0.06},{"w":"disconnection","s":-0.03},{"w":"does","s":0.07},{"w":"apply","s":0.11},{"w":"percentage","s":0.06},{"w":"disconnection","s":-0.03}]},"predictions":{"conflux":{"pred":"line_fault","probs":{"line_fault":0.975,"breaker_fault":0.0201,"transformer_fault":0.0018,"busbar_fault":0.0031},"confidence":0.975,"correct":true},"quorum":{"pred":"line_fault","probs":{"line_fault":0.4389,"breaker_fault":0.2761,"transformer_fault":0.1082,"busbar_fault":0.1768},"confidence":0.4389,"correct":true},"nexus":{"pred":"line_fault","probs":{"line_fault":0.6109,"breaker_fault":0.2559,"transformer_fault":0.1198,"busbar_fault":0.0134},"confidence":0.6109,"correct":true}},"explanations":{"conflux":{"method":"Exact Shapley (Modality) + Gradient Attribution (Wit